      "side": 1,
      "message": "**Ignored CLI Arguments (VID/PID)** In `iaptool.cc`, you\u0027ve implemented `CommandLineManager` to parse `-V` (VID) and `-P` (PID) from the user. However, these values are never passed to the device control layer.\n\n* In `iaptool.cc`: `iapCtrl.initialize()` is called without arguments.  \n* In `iapcontrol.cc`: `initialize()` hardcodes the search to `connectDevice(BOOT_VID, BOOT_PID);`.  \n* **Remediation:** Modify `iapcontrol::initialize(uint16_t vid, uint16_t pid)` to accept the parsed VID and PID.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 77,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 97,
        "endChar": 1
      },
      "revId": "a9ae4653beb18e714eb31c3825485624347d71c8",
